SUMMARY:COMING THIS SATURDAY July 11 | Pickin’ Peaches: An Allman Brothers Tribute
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, July 11 | Doors: 7 pm | Show: 8 pm | Outdoor Stage | $16.85 adv Event Details & Tickets \nPickin’ Peaches: An Allman Brothers Tribute\n\nKyle Travers\, Eric Travers\, Mike Barnes\, Marcus White\, Mike Rhodes\, Ben Bjorlie and Keith Held play the music of The Allman Brothers Band on July 11 at Pisgah Brewing Co. Outdoor Stage.\n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom & deli\, with live music several days a week\, plus an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-saturday-july-11-pickin-peaches-an-allman-brothers-tribute/2026-07-07/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/682077273_1440645391422966_8411275264552838380_n-e1777565142405.jpg
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
